{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46900","headline":"湘江送客 · 齐己","name":"湘江送客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘江秋色湛如冰，楚客离怀暮不胜。\n千里碧云闻塞鴈，几程青草见巴陵。\n寒涛响叠晨征樐，岸苇丛明夜泊灯。\n鹦鹉洲边若回首，爲思前事一扪膺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}